msgid "Project Management (spec v0.2)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:8
msgid ""
"Structured project management for FreeAnima, based on the [Unified Entity "
"Model](../concepts/entity-model.md). **v1** delivers: project folder tree, "
"project entity, task ownership migration, and milestones. OKR, cross-entity "
"links, Gantt/Kanban, and file assets are **[v2+]** (see [Non-goals (v1)]"
"(#non-goals-v1))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/project.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Concept hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/project.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"project_folder (organizational tree, independent from task_list folders)\n"
" └── project (leaf — cannot nest)\n"
"      ├── milestone (time anchors inside the project)\n"
"      └── task_item (via body.project_id; optional body.milestone_id)\n"
"task module (/tasks) — lists, smart lists, backlog tasks (body.project_id empty)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:20
msgid ""
"Project folders and task-list folders are **separate trees**. The task "
"module remains the **Backlog / ad-hoc task pool** for items not assigned to "
"a project."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/project.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Folders (`project_folder`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:26
msgid ""
"Independent folder hierarchy for project management only — **not shared** "
"with task-list folders (`task_list.is_folder`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Rule             | Detail                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Nesting          | Unlimited depth; pure organization                                                                       |\n"
"| No lifecycle     | No start/end dates, completion criteria, or terminal status                                              |\n"
"| Parent           | `body.parent_id` → another `project_folder` entity id, or `null` at root                                 |\n"
"| Cycle prevention | Same as task-list folders — nesting must not form cycles                                                 |\n"
"| Delete           | Recursively removes sub-folders; contained projects get `folder_id: null` (projects are **not** deleted) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[v2+]** Folder-level Gantt / Kanban views aggregating all projects under the folder.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:38
msgid "Example layout:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/project.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FreeAnima (product tag or top folder name)\n"
" ├── 0.8\n"
" │    └── Ship 0.8.5 (project)\n"
" └── 0.9\n"
"      └── Memory pipeline v2 (project)\n"
msgstr ""

