#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/project.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic attributes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/project.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Rule                | Detail                                                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Leaf node           | Projects **cannot nest**. Use `project_folder` for grouping                                               |\n"
"| Schedule            | **Required** `start_at` and `end_at` (or explicit end condition encoded as `end_at`) at create time       |\n"
"| Completion criteria | **Required** at create — what counts as \"done\" (stored in entity `content` or `body.completion_criteria`) |\n"
"| Terminal status     | `completed` / `cancelled` / `on_hold` (plus default `active`)                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

